# -- end of source
# `visit` hands `current` to `note`, and how `note` uses its parameter says how `current` is used. But `note` stores a record of its own over the parameter, and that record is no word on what was handed in:
# `current` never holds one. It used to be written as what `current` is expected to hold, and every read off `current` was tested for a record that never came.
# RUN(TEXT): print
